 "description": "<div class=\"ExternalClass574CEF0F73C84159A135A5A57C106C30\"><p>This dataset includes all of the voting places available to voters for the 2011 general election.</p><p>Prior to the 2014 municipal election, the city was divided into voting divisions and voters were required to vote at a designated voting place within their assigned voting division.</p><p>The City of Vancouver now uses a Vote-Anywhere model. Voters can vote at any voting place within the City. </p><p>The City operates an at-large voting system. </p><p><strong>Note:</strong></p><p>UBC Lands and UEL residents are only eligible to vote for School Trustees.</p></div><h3>Data accuracy</h3><div class=\"ExternalClass9139D9F174A9441A9639FDC02B941F8B\"><p>Some attribute names may change from election to election and are not directly comparable over time.</p></div><h3>Data currency</h3><div class=\"ExternalClass312633447D704227A42A07677C3CC9DC\"><p>These are the voting places used for the City's 2011 municipal elections during Advance Voting and on General Voting Day.</p></div><h3>Websites for further information</h3><div class=\"ExternalClass55CF9FB5FE4B4D6A90106F1057DFD0D2\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://opendata.vancouver.ca/explore/dataset/municipal-election-results/\">Municipal election results</a></li><li><a href=\"https://opendata.vancouver.ca/explore/dataset/voting-division-boundaries-2011/\">Voting division boundaries</a> (applicable only for municipal elections prior to 2014)</li></ul></div>",
